\caption{3D map of rectified DC sheath potential \(V_{\rm sheath}^{\rm RF}\) computed using COMSOL for WEST discharge \#57877. Peak voltages exceed 250~V and are concentrated near the upper sections antenna limiters' front and sidewalls.}
