To improve interpretability, SHAP (SHapley Additive exPlanations)  \cite{bib36} values were computed for the clinical modality. These values quantify the contribution of each clinical feature to individual survival predictions. Beeswarm and bar plots (Figures \ref{xai1} and \ref{xai2}) were generated to visualize both the global importance and local effects of features.

