\end{bmatrix}$}
\label{eq: apx5}
\end{equation}

For the longitudinal mode $(n,m)=(1,0)$ or $(q_n,q_m)=(q,0)$, the coupling is given by $(\theta,\Omega)$ and the matrix simplifies to,
\begin{equation}
    \label{eq: longitudinal mode}
     \mathcal{J}_{10}(q,0)=
    \begin{bmatrix}
        -\frac{K q^2}{\gamma} &\frac{1+\lambda}{2} -i \frac{\beta}{q}\\
