\section{Experiments}
\label{sec:experiments}
To assess the effectiveness of our proposed RL-based autoscaling framework, {KIScaler}, we conduct a series of experiments on a GPU-enabled Kubernetes cluster under dynamic and variable workload conditions. The objective is to determine whether KIScaler can improve inference performance and resource utilization compared to the default HPA. All workloads are based on MobileNetV4 models served via the NVIDIA Triton Inference Server, simulating realistic GPU-accelerated inference services in a containerized environment.


\subsection{Environment and Workloads}
